data: {"id": "bff640eed2884f1d-final", "run_id": "bff640eed2884f1d", "seq": 1058, "ts_ms": 1789049654856, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 处于 `Pending` 阶段，Pod Condition `ContainersReady=False`；`container.waiting_reason` 显示 `ContainerCreating` | 定义容器停滞的具体状态阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition` (发生27次，间隔15m) | 确认集群核心故障机制为挂载操作超时 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (发生45次，间隔78s) | 精确定位故障实体：缺失的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Volume 命名为 `input`，且容器 `app` 的资源配置极低（CPU Request 5m, Memory Request 8Mi） | 排除资源耗尽导致的挂载延迟，指向配置定义错误 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 在 `ContainerCreating` 状态下值为 `1` | 独立观测印证 Pod 卡在初始化等待阶段 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 `0` | 确认 Pod 从未成功启动，未发生过应用级别的崩溃与重启 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n1. K8s Event 中的两条 `FailedMount` 消息存在因果递进：第一条说明系统尝试挂载 `input` 卷失败并超时，第二条明确了失败原因是所引用的 `configmap \"unavailable-config\"` 不存在。\n2. `ContainerCreating` 状态与 `restart_count=0` 结合，确认 Pod 始终处于调度后的挂载初始化阶段，未能进入容器运行时。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在当前 namespace 中不存在 → Volume 'input' 挂载初始化失败 (FailedMount) → 容器状态滞留于 ContainerCreating (Waiting) → Pod 进入 Pending 状态，无法对外提供服务\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 定义的 Volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'**。\n\n该缺失的配置资源导致 kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时返回错误 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。随后，kubelet 持续重试挂载操作直至超时，触发 `FailedMount` 事件，使 Pod 始终停滞在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段（证据 #2, #3, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 25.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 68.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 68.6s (Evidence 60.6s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 102.74, "metrics": {"run_id": "bff640eed2884f1d", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 102.74803757667542, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 102748.03757667542, "llm_calls": 19, "llm_duration_ms": 98949.41401481628, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 7, "successful_tool_calls": 23, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 7131.929874420166, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3386.8978023529053}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 25146.599531173706, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 68595.99280357361, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8983.13593864441, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

